      "created_at": "2019-05-10T17:29:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So: FF5 Wraith's power says \"Draw a card.&nbsp; Until the end of your next turn, whenever you draw a card, you may discard a card.&nbsp; If you do, another player draws a card.\" If you activate Clandestine Funding multiple times in a round, she gets multiple opportunities to discard and give a draw to someone else each time she draws.&nbsp; 2 Clandestine Fundings means 2 chances to discard, 3 is 3, and so on.</p>\n<p>Malpractice Medico says \"Until the end of your next turn, the first time each hero target would regain hp each turn, Dr Medico deals 1 target that amount of energy damage instead.\"&nbsp; Activating this power multiple times does not trigger multiple instances of damage the first time each hero is healed in a turn. &nbsp;</p>\n<p>Why is one one way and the other the other?&nbsp; I can't parse it from the rules.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:46.591Z",
