      "raw": "<p>So... things go in the order they entered play as per usual, but because it's \"instead\" by the time the later-entered Malpractice looks at the first time the hero gained&nbsp; hp it's already been transformed into something else and it can't see it?&nbsp; I can see that being valid, but I wouldn't have bet on it ahead of time.&nbsp; Or, if I did bet on this interpretation, I might have also bet that the next heal would have triggered the next Malpractice, because by the time it looked at the healing it would no longer be healing and therefore it would still be looking for its \"first\" one.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ah, well.&nbsp; Still stuff to learn after years of playing, not too bad, SotM!</p>",
